ium Arts that bears greater vitality. One who was powerful in life will continue to be a great threat to their enemies even after being reshaped by the power of the Sanguinarch's blessing.","abilities":["Reborn Creation (takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage)","Units blocking it gain +1 Block (up to a maximum of +6)"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":680,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"sarkaz_heirbearer_punisher":{"slug":"sarkaz_heirbearer_punisher","name":"Sarkaz Heirbearer Punisher","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Heirbearer Punisher.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A formation-breaker of the Sarkaz Royal Court that has received the blessing of the Sanguinarch of Vampires. Said to have violated the taboos of the Court, however the Sanguinarch did not punish them for their transgressions. Instead, they now inflict upon others the pain that should have befallen them.","abilities":["After several attacks, Stuns friendly units in an area.","Will be reborn as a <Gift of the Sanguinarch> after falling in battle for the first time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":1200,"def":100,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"anti_witchcraft_repositionable_bomb":{"slug":"anti_witchcraft_repositionable_bomb","name":"Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb","icon":"/enemies-icons/Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A bomb whose explosion can suppress the effects of Sarkaz witchcraft, with a prototype delivery platform originating from Victoria. After being modified by a certain demolition expert, it has become a trump card in ou